    "sentence_translations": [
      "Mahjong enters the Olympics?",
      "",
      "In April this year, the International Mind Sports Association declared that following contract bridge, chess, and Go, ..",
      ".. Mahjong was officially chosen as a mind sport item to represent Chinese traditional board and card game culture.",
      "",
      "The chairman of the IMSA said that they were in the process of applying to the international Olympic committee, ..",
      ".. to turn Mahjong and other mind sports into Winter Olympic indoor performance items.",
      "So it is possible that Mahjong will appear in the 2022 Beijing Olympics.",
      "",
      "As soon as this news came out, Chinese netizens were thrilled.",
      "One after another they said: now we have another program where Chinese people can take over the world.",
      "Someone also said:",
      "From now on when I see the elders playing Mahjong, I can't say that they're just wasting their time.",
      "They're all fighting for their country to win!",
      ""
